// prop_lab: fetched from TradingView 2026-10-08
// url: https://www.tradingview.com/script/RNxThUtE-EMA-Slope-RSI-Oscillator-Strategy/
// id: PUB;57c657fed44c4cdb9ab493956f37ddbb  kind: strategy  likes: 679
